{'symbol': 'CSGP', 'date': '2023-05-26 13:42:00', 'title': 'COSTAR GROUP SIGNS SCIENCE BASED TARGETS INITIATIVE (SBTI) COMMITMENT FOR EMISSIONS REDUCTION', 'text': "WASHINGTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, COSTAR GROUP, A LEADING PROVIDER OF ONLINE REAL ESTATE MARKETPLACES, INFORMATION AND ANALYTICS IN THE PROPERTY MARKETS, ANNOUNCED THAT ITS FOUNDER AND CEO ANDY FLORANCE HAS SIGNED A COMMITMENT LETTER TO SET NEAR-TERM AND LONG-TERM SCIENCE-BASED GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSION REDUCTION TARGETS IN ACCORDANCE WITH THE SCIENCE BASED TARGETS INITIATIVE (SBTI). SBTI'S SCIENCE-BASED REDUCTION TARGETS ARE ALIGNED WITH THE LEVEL OF DECARBONIZATION NECESSARY TO MEET THE GOALS."}